To preserve the great OpenAstro program by Pelle van der Scheer
from oblivion, find it here slightly modified and adapted.
The former separate files from 'openastro-data' are now fully integrated.
Now working with pyswisseph-2.10.3

The programs are written in python with use of pyGtk
for the Gnome GTK3 resp. GTK4 environment of Linux.

There are four programs:
1) openastro v1.1.70 Gtk3 final
2( astroChartBuilder.py v1.1.90 Gtk3
3) astroChartShow.py Gtk44 - a simple SVG Viewer
4) astroChart.py v1.1.90 - Gtk44

